Outliers detection methods:
    1. Boxplot/IQR Method 
        Outliers are values outside the range:
            [Q1 - 1.5 * IQR, Q3 + 1.5 * IQR]
            IQR = Q3 - Q1
    
    2. Z-score method 
        z = (x - mean)/SD
        Outliers are defined as |z|>3

    3. Visualization
        Boxplots and Violinplots are great for spotting outliers visually
        Scatter plots can also reveal extreme points

